    "detailed_description": "Set in a dystopian alternate history, &quot;Index: Purger&quot; is a dynamic, fast-paced first-person shooter where you play as an elite &quot;Omega Security&quot; mercenary, battling through intense, chaotic combat scenarios. With an expansive array of equipment and perks, you can create your own unique approach to the chaos and dominate your enemies. When not on the job, step into the lively cityscape, undertaking a range of quests and immersing yourself in the worldbuilding of Index-0. Experience this unique shooter adventure and become the ultimate mercenary!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Start from The Get-Inn Mall Defense mission and hop into bloody rabbit hole of the corporate military conflict with M.Inc.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3f27894540487f546b07b5614c0be6b3.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3f27894540487f546b07b5614c0be6b3.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3f27894540487f546b07b5614c0be6b3.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Various firearms and weaponry, such as assault-rifles, pistols, PDW's, shotguns, sniper rifles and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3b6935be4de12896eca8ac8417a7fa61.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3b6935be4de12896eca8ac8417a7fa61.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/3b6935be4de12896eca8ac8417a7fa61.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Various enemy units with their own skills and logic, such as M.Inc. chemical units, electo-units, heavy units, or just bandits that you can find somewhere at the &quot;Restricted Zone.&quot;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/0fb21c8c0edbb1947d6d930bfefefc0a.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/0fb21c8c0edbb1947d6d930bfefefc0a.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/0fb21c8c0edbb1947d6d930bfefefc0a.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Mystery perk?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/2c624694741be78db4b6feb845a0766e.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/2c624694741be78db4b6feb845a0766e.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/2c624694741be78db4b6feb845a0766e.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Citizen life with a freedom of your own choice. Would you like to just accomplish your citizen day fast or will you commit crimes?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/59f83eb887a0b9b8ed290e9482ec510a.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/59f83eb887a0b9b8ed290e9482ec510a.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/59f83eb887a0b9b8ed290e9482ec510a.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Talk with characters and get a deeper understanding of the world of this game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Interact with surrounding props, drop a chair on someone to make them fall on ground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.poster.avif?t=1752318710\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.webm?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742480/extras/531576a6d4ddbade03474e90dc076bc6.mp4?t=1752318710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><i>Thanks to ostap_bender for throughout support of this game during early development period and for this Steam page as well.</i><br><br><i>The game is still in develop